@TaskManagementApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180
@token = paste-access-token-here

### 1. Login and copy accessToken from the response
POST {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 2. This request should return 401 when no valid token is supplied
GET {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get all tasks (replace @token with the token from login)
GET {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get one task by ID
GET {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create a task
POST {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Learn JWT Authentication",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### 6. Update a task
PUT {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Learn JWT Authentication and EF Core",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 7. Delete a task
DELETE {{TaskManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
